WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:05.480
When you ask people who the strongest straw
hats are, they will without a doubt tell you

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.100
Luffy and Zoro.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.490
But Sanji???

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:15.320
There’s some intense debate about how strong
he actually is, so to end the Sanji hate once

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:20.039
and for all, let’s give him a simply broken
devil fruit to take him into the top-tier

00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:21.189
of fighters in the story.

00:00:21.189 --> 00:00:25.150
But that just leaves one very important question…

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:28.080
Which devil fruit is perfect for Sanji??

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:33.570
And let’s start with one of the coolest
devil fruits in the story, the Ice fruit.

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:39.950
And to explain why these chilly powers are
simply one of the best devil fruits for Sanji,

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:44.780
we have to break down exactly what makes our
curly-eyebrow chef so special.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:51.059
For example, one of Sanji’s main passions
is cooking, so his perfect devil fruit would

00:00:51.059 --> 00:00:55.469
definitely need to somehow contribute to his
cooking skills.

00:00:55.469 --> 00:01:00.920
And the Ice devil fruit would absolutely help
Sanji as a chef because what cook doesn’t

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:02.920
need a way to keep their food cold?

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:05.160
He’s basically his own refrigerator.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:11.231
On top of that, being able to freeze temperatures
has a ton of applications as a chef and you

00:01:11.231 --> 00:01:15.770
can make special dishes by being able to instantly
freeze food.

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:21.490
What’s even more special though is that
this is one of the only fruits that can literally

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:27.130
create water, so the Straw Hats would simply
never run out of water with Sanji around.

00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:31.350
So all around, pretty strong in the cooking
category.

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:36.600
Besides that though, we have to consider how
the devil fruit would improve his no-hands

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:38.090
fighting style.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:45.350
Of course, the Sanji we know post-Wano already
has a super strong body and incredible strength,

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:52.189
but the Ice fruit would give him huge boosts
in defense and attack power earlier in the

00:01:52.189 --> 00:01:58.200
story which could make him nearly unstoppable
in basically every one of his main fights.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:02.930
Plus, the Ice fruit would easily enhance Sanji’s
kicking-based combat.

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:07.090
He could just make his legs super cold which
could freeze anyone he touches.

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:12.730
He could also add icy blades to his kicks
or even combine his natural fire powers with

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:17.390
these new ice abilities to be the ultimate
hot and cold fighter.

00:02:17.390 --> 00:02:22.420
Plus he could shoot out ice projectiles and
even freeze water so the straw hats never

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:24.950
have to worry about drowning ever again.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:30.420
Plus I’m sure he could tag team with Nami
to create some INSANE weather based attacks

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:33.470
by creating cold air for Nami to manipulate.

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:40.340
So at this point, you might be thinking THIS
IS the perfect fruit for Sanji, but we’ve

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:47.360
got many more that might be even better for
the Straw Hat’s chef, including the one

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:49.330
he dreamed about as a child.

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:56.340
This is of course the Suke Suke no mi, otherwise
known as the Invisibility fruit.

00:02:56.340 --> 00:03:01.510
And for many people, this is the first power
they think about when it comes to giving Snaji

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:02.510
a fruit.

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:09.290
That’s because during the Thriller Bark
arc, we learned Sanji wanted to eat this fruit

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:13.410
ever since he was a kid because of, well,
some rather perverted reasons.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:18.080
And if that was all Sanji used this fruit
for then honestly he probably wouldn’t live

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:23.980
very long with the straw hats because I’m
sure Nami would straight up kill him for peeking

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:24.980
in on her showers.

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:32.680
But let’s assume he could control himself
when it came to the ladies and seriously evaluate

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:35.890
this fruit for Sanji.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:41.860
First off, the invisibility power is obviously
very useful in combat as he could hide from

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:42.860
most opponents.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:49.330
In fact, he already had an invisibility power
up in Wano with his family’s technology,

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:52.799
but he chose to destroy his invisible suit.

00:03:52.799 --> 00:03:58.439
Not that it mattered though because at this
point Sanji moves so fast he is basically

00:03:58.439 --> 00:03:59.890
already invisible.

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:04.510
So that power would again just be a huge buff
for early story Sanji.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:09.760
Besides that though this fruit wouldn’t
be all that useful for Sanji since it doesn’t

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.670
make him any stronger.

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:16.479
It also doesn’t help with his cooking much
except for maybe keeping his dishes a surprise.

00:04:16.479 --> 00:04:23.290
So overall I don’t think this fruit is all
that great as a serious option for Sanji.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:29.840
But this next fruit might actually be the
BEST FRUIT for chef Sanji.

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:34.139
Because we all know a knife is a chef’s
best friend.

00:04:34.139 --> 00:04:41.300
So of course any chef would simply love to
get the Dice fruit, which allows the user

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:44.770
to turn any part of their body into a blade.

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:51.190
Which is just perfect for Sanji since he is
constantly slicing and dicing food in the

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:52.190
kitchen.

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:56.650
But beyond knives, he could turn himself into
so many different kinds of blades that are

00:04:56.650 --> 00:05:01.410
useful in the kitchen, such as a spinning
blade to use as a blender or a rough blade

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:02.930
to act as a grater.

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:07.680
So clearly this fruit has endless uses in
the kitchen.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:12.169
Beyond that though it also perfectly fits
with Sanji’s fighting style because he can

00:05:12.169 --> 00:05:17.470
just turn his entire leg into a blade and
use that to attack his opponents.

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:21.520
Which would make him even more deadly than
he already is.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:26.530
In particular, this fruit would have helped
Sanji A TON during his brief clash with Doflamingo

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:32.150
because if we assume by this point Sanji is
pretty good with his fruit and has decent

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:38.250
levels of haki, then there is literally no
better power to fight Doflamingo’s strings

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.070
than a bunch of blades.

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:46.610
So who knows, there might not even have been
a Dressrosa arc if Sanji had this fruit.

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:52.100
However, I have to admit it would be a bit
weird to see Sanji using blades since that

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:54.729
has always been Zoro’s thing.

00:05:54.729 --> 00:05:59.180
Plus can you just imagine Sanji doing this
to his captain with a blade-leg.

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:01.169
Yikes.

00:06:01.169 --> 00:06:03.430
That would be bye bye Luffy.

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:10.139
Although, I guess Sanji and Zoro could take
their rivalry to the next level by dueling

00:06:10.139 --> 00:06:11.139
with their blades.

00:06:11.139 --> 00:06:15.860
If we’re being honest though Sanji would
need a ton of practice to learn how to use

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:21.270
this fruit, which he actually wouldn’t need
if he ate this next fruit.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:27.780
And before you laugh, just know that this
is my personal favorite fruit for Sanji, which

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:32.319
is the Big Horned Sheep devil fruit.

00:06:32.319 --> 00:06:39.000
And while this fruit is currently not in the
story, the inspiration for this power comes

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:45.229
from the chapter 651 color spread where we
see the entire crew as animals.

00:06:45.229 --> 00:06:52.190
And man, I just think this is so hilarious
to look at, but if you think about it, being

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:57.060
a Big Horned Sheep could actually be a huge
fighting boot for Sanji.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:07:02.370
Because if you didn’t know these animals
are known for their incredible jumping and

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:11.020
balance which allows them to climb entire
cliffs by jumping up to twenty feet and landing

00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:12.840
on tiny ledges.

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:19.020
Which means that for Sanji, who attacks mostly
with jumps and kicks, adding this natural

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:24.450
boost to his leg strength would make him even
more powerful than he already is.

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:31.509
Of course, this is also a Zoan fruit so Sanji
would also get natural boosts in all of his

00:07:31.509 --> 00:07:35.010
physical stats like strength, speed, endurance,
and recovery.

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:40.430
Plus he gets the hybrid and full zoan forms,
which surprisingly might change his fighting

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:41.870
style quite a bit.

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:47.199
I mean, his rule is to never fight with his
hands, but if he has these massive horns on

00:07:47.199 --> 00:07:51.560
his head, he would have to use them, right???

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:55.840
However, the one downside to this fruit is
that it doesn’t have any real applications

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:57.470
for Sanji as a chef.

00:07:57.470 --> 00:08:04.729
So while it would be AWESOME, it probably
isn’t the BEST FRUIT for Sanji as a cook.

00:08:04.729 --> 00:08:11.660
Which is the exact opposite of this next fruit,
which is the Cook Cook fruit that we were

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:14.540
introduced to during the Whole Cake Island
arc.

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:21.810
In case you don’t remember, this fruit allows
you to basically turn anything into food.

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:29.150
For example, this guy turned this log into
slices of meat and he later turned Big Mom’s

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:33.100
entire castle into a giant sponge cake.

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:38.570
So of course we have to discuss this fruit
because it seems absolutely perfect for a

00:08:38.570 --> 00:08:40.580
chef like Sanji, right???

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:47.090
Well, I’m here to tell you that no, this
fruit would DESTROY the Sanji we know and

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:48.090
love.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:52.550
For one, this is basically like a cheat code
for a chef since you really don’t even need

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.209
to cook to make food.

00:08:54.209 --> 00:08:59.930
And for someone like Sanji who takes A TON
of pride in his cooking, he would likely feel

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:04.200
like he’d rather cook something incredible
on his own rather than just instantly making

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:06.209
food with his devil fruit.

00:09:06.209 --> 00:09:11.980
Or if he ate this fruit as a kid and relied
on it for his cooking, he might have actually

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:15.200
never gotten to be the incredible chef that
he is today.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:19.810
Plus, we aren’t even entirely sure how good
the food made by this fruit tastes.

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:24.420
Big Mom certainly didn’t like the taste
of the cake made from the fruit, so it’s

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:27.500
possible that the food doesn’t taste good
at all.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:34.150
Although to be fair the quality of the food
probably depends on the skill of the user

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:39.070
and the situation, so food made in an emergency
probably wouldn’t be as good as something

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:40.580
made with time and preparation.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:47.610
To be fair though, this is literally the perfect
fruit to have if you run out of food like

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:49.750
the crew did while sailing to Whole Cake Island.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:55.370
However, I have serious doubts about Sanji
using this fruit in combat.

00:09:55.370 --> 00:10:02.140
The only way I see Sanji using this fruit
in a fight is to turn other people’s weapons

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:03.140
into food.

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:07.620
For example, if he was fighting a swordsman,&nbsp;
Sanji could probably turn his opponent’s

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.160
sword into food.

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:14.510
That would seriously weaken his opponent,
but if we’re being honest it’s a pretty

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:19.709
weak combat ability compared to the other
powers we’ve already mentioned and the ones

00:10:19.709 --> 00:10:21.380
coming up next.

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:27.290
Because even though the Cook fruit was not
a great fit for Sanji, there is a food-based

00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:30.839
devil fruit that is a WAY BETTER fit.

00:10:30.839 --> 00:10:40.180
That is the Mochi devil fruit, which would
be absolutely PERFECT if we had to pick a

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:42.000
food-based devil fruit.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:46.970
That’s because this so called Special Paramecia
devil fruit has nearly all of the benefits

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:53.079
of a Logia fruit with the added benefit being
that the substance Sanji could turn into is

00:10:53.079 --> 00:10:54.500
also edible.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:57.690
So it’s great for combat and in the kitchen.

00:10:57.690 --> 00:10:58.870
Let’s break it down.

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:04.110
Of course with mochi, Sanji could make an
endless supply of mochi-based treats, so in

00:11:04.110 --> 00:11:08.709
theory the crew would never go hungry, which
is a major bonus for this fruit.

00:11:08.709 --> 00:11:15.260
However, since Sanji can turn his body into
mochi AND produce the sticky-sweet substance

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:18.330
he gets a major boost in all of his combat
moves.

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:23.399
For example, as we saw when Big Mom’s strongest
son, Katakuri, used this devil fruit, Sanji

00:11:23.399 --> 00:11:27.660
would be able to create mochi projectiles
and take out opponents from far away.

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:32.920
He could also enhance his kicks with mochi
by making his legs extra strong or even extending

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:33.920
their reach.

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:39.650
So yeah, this is an optimal fruit if we are
combining his role as a chef and a fighter.

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:46.150
However, even the mochi fruit simply CANNOT
COMPARE to the incredible power of the Pika

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:50.320
Pika no mi, also known as the light devil
fruit.

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:56.100
And man, this fruit regularly ranks near the
top strongest devil lists.

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:57.820
And for good reason.

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:04.170
Since this fruit is a Logia, Sanji would get
the obvious benefits of being able to turn

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:06.500
into light and shoot out light lasers.

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:10.950
And there is almost no better fruit to enhance
Sanji’s fighting style than by making him

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:12.290
faster.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:18.940
We’ve already seen just how devastatingly
fast Sanji is during the Wano arc, but this

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:21.769
fruit would take him to a whole other level.

00:12:21.769 --> 00:12:27.019
On top of just making him faster, Sanji would
also be able to shoot laser light beams, although

00:12:27.019 --> 00:12:32.699
as with many of these fruits, it is questionable
if Sanji would ever use a ranged attack like

00:12:32.699 --> 00:12:33.699
this.

00:12:33.699 --> 00:12:38.730
We have actually seen him pull out a gun twice
in the story, but he’s never fired a bullet.

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:42.560
So would he shoot out light bullets with his
devil fruit?

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:47.470
It’s debatable, for sure, but as long as
he’s not using his hands I feel like Sanji

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:48.699
would do it.

00:12:48.699 --> 00:12:54.210
So without a doubt, this fruit is a monster
for combat.

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:56.390
But how about in the kitchen?

00:12:56.390 --> 00:13:04.510
Well, in order to effectively use light for
cooking, Sanji would need incredible control

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:06.050
of this power.

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:11.941
But if he could manage that, he could use
his light to heat up and cook food, since

00:13:11.941 --> 00:13:14.990
light heats up objects as it passes through
them.

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:19.410
So much like the Ice devil fruit, this could
lead to some fancy new cooking techniques

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:23.430
that I’m sure Sanji would absolutely love
to test out.

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:28.899
But there’s one thing the light fruit wouldn’t
do for Sanji, and that is get rid of his number

00:13:28.899 --> 00:13:29.899
one weakness.

00:13:29.899 --> 00:13:34.730
Of course, I’m talking about the fact that
Sanji refuses to fight women, which has cost

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:38.440
him badly on more than once in the story.

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:44.079
However, to counter this exact weakness, there
are actually TWO fruits that would help Sanji

00:13:44.079 --> 00:13:46.460
never have to fight a woman ever again.

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:51.589
I’m talking about this guy’s Hormone fruit
which can inject someone with enough hormones

00:13:51.589 --> 00:13:53.430
to make them switch genders.

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:58.579
So that’s one option, and the other one
involves a brief manga spoiler here, but we

00:13:58.579 --> 00:14:06.220
also have this guy’s Sick-Sick fruit, which
can infect people with a gender-swapping disease.

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:10.630
Both of these would allow Sanji to change
women into men so that he would have no problem

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:11.630
fighting them.

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:15.380
Which basically takes away his biggest weakness
as a fighter.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:19.290
Although knowing Sanji, he would probably
never want to change a woman into a man, so

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:22.259
maybe these aren’t so great for him after
all.

00:14:22.259 --> 00:14:28.600
So even with all of these incredible fruits,
I still wonder if we could somehow craft the

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:34.389
perfect devil fruit for Sanji that would put
him on the same level as Luffy and Zoro.

00:14:34.389 --> 00:14:40.839
And since those two are both essentially gods
- Luffy is a Sun God, and Zoro has his Ashura

00:14:40.839 --> 00:14:48.690
demon power - I figured, why not try to give
Sanji some mythical god powers as well.

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:53.670
So after doing some research, I found that
there is a Shinto deity called Ukemochi who

00:14:53.670 --> 00:14:55.889
is the god of food.

00:14:55.889 --> 00:15:01.899
Which just sounds perfect for Sanji because
Ukemochi is said to be able to create any

00:15:01.899 --> 00:15:04.910
kind of food or even help crops to grow better.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:10.710
That is obviously a plus in the chef category,
since Sanji could produce any ingredient he

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:14.830
could imagine to create some truly out of
this world recipes.

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:20.230
Seriously, Sanji would be in heaven, especially
since his dream of finding the All Blue specifically

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:25.430
mentions cooking with some special fish you
can’t find anywhere else in the world.

00:15:25.430 --> 00:15:28.699
So yeah, this fruit is perfect for Sanji the
chef.

00:15:28.699 --> 00:15:32.470
Fighting is another matter though, because
at first it doesn’t seem like this fruit

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:35.209
would have any real effect on his fighting.

00:15:35.209 --> 00:15:39.610
And you might think that with his endless
supply of ingredients, Sanji could whip up

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:44.420
some deadly dishes to poison his opponents,
but I truly don’t think that Sanji would

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:46.589
EVER want to make food that would hurt someone.

00:15:46.589 --> 00:15:51.810
So let’s flip this around and imagine that
with enough practice, Sanji could make food

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:57.370
that actually boosts his own strength, endurance,
recovery, or some other characteristic.

00:15:57.370 --> 00:16:02.699
So I’m just imagining him getting ready
to fight by taking a bite of a special strength

00:16:02.699 --> 00:16:04.700
boosting meal or something.

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:08.769
Which would be perfect to share with the entire
crew.

00:16:08.769 --> 00:16:11.440
Although I don’t really know if he would
share it with Zoro.

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:16.760
This fruit might even be enough to settle
their age-old rivalry once and for all.

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:23.460
However, that is only considering Zoro at
his current strength, but it would be a completely

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:28.620
different story if Zoro had his own devil
fruit to compete with Sanji’s.

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:34.450
And if you want to see which fruit is the
PERFECT ONE for our green-haired swordsman,

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:36.720
you can watch this video right here.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:39.730
Shanks for watching, and I’ll see you in
the next one.

